<h2>About Kindeva</h2>

<p>Kindeva is a leading Contract Development and Manufacturing Organization (CDMO) specializing in complex drug delivery systems. The company holds the distinction of being the <strong>first to patent the inhaler</strong>, pioneering respiratory drug delivery technology that has transformed how patients receive life-saving medications for asthma, COPD, and other respiratory conditions.</p>

<p>With decades of innovation in drug-device combination products, Kindeva continues to lead the industry in developing and manufacturing inhaled therapies, transdermal patches, and other advanced drug delivery systems.</p>

<p><strong>Below:</strong> Brand activation materials, swag design, mobile marketing campaign documentation</p>

<h2>Marketing Activation & Brand Ambassadorship</h2>

<p>We hit the streets of Manhattan again for another DCAT Week Conference, this time for the <strong>@kindevadd</strong> brand.</p>

<p>Wearing Kindeva orange, our brand ambassadors handed out sweet treats and memorable swag, from cake pops and custom branded mint candy to <strong>inhaler-shaped stress balls</strong> - a clever nod to Kindeva's pioneering history as the first to patent the inhaler.</p>

<p>Plus we rolled <strong>three LED billboard trucks</strong> through high traffic areas, pumping music and good vibes to everyone we passed. This mobile marketing approach created a dynamic, eye-catching presence throughout Manhattan, ensuring Kindeva's brand message reached far beyond the convention center walls.</p>

